9.1 Cognitive Transition Exclusion

Definition 9.1. A cognitive transition is one whose acting agent is in A_{\text{cognitive}}.

Invariant I-2 (Policy integrity).

\Box \; \forall a \in A_{\text{cognitive}} : \operatorname{Transition}_a \Longrightarrow \Pi' = \Pi.

