Chapter 17 — Threat Model

17.1 Adversaries

A — Compromised cognitive agent. Arbitrary requests; no KSI state modification.

B — Malicious peer. Delegation exploitation; shared resources.

C — Compromised supervisor. False assessments.

D — Policy-service compromise. Over-broad grants; base assumptions violated.

E — Governance failure. Procedural but not normative validity.

F — Implementation failure. Memory safety, configuration, cryptography, caches.

17.2 Capability Inclusion

\text{Cap}(A) \subset \text{Cap}(B) \subset \text{Cap}(C) \subset \text{Cap}(D).

17.3 Excluded

Hardware compromise; unrestricted superintelligence; physical coercion.

